Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Na view Não Lidas, clicar nas abas Minhas/Não atribuídas/Todos mudava só o
estado interno (activeAssigneeTab) sem atualizar a URL → a barra de endereço
ficava "presa" (ex.: ?assignee_type=all com a aba "Minhas" destacada).

updateAssigneeTab só tratava conversationType==='unattended' via router.push;
'unread' caía no else que apenas setava o estado. Adicionado branch 'unread'
espelhando o unattended: router.push para conversation_unread com
?assignee_type=me|unassigned|all explícito nas 3 abas (sempre explícito, pois
o default do unread é ALL, não ME). O watcher de deep-link sincroniza a aba e
refaz o fetch — sem loop (o watcher nunca chama router) e sem
NavigationDuplicated (vue-router 4 retorna NavigationFailure; onTabChange já
guarda key!==activeTab).

Verificado por review adversarial multi-agente: sem bypass de entry-points
(Alt+N/ChatTypeTabs passam por updateAssigneeTab), paridade com unattended,
init resolve ?assignee_type=all -> aba "Todos" corretamente.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../dashboard/components/ChatList.vue           | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 17 insertions(+)

diff --git a/app/javascript/dashboard/components/ChatList.vue b/app/javascript/dashboard/components/ChatList.vue
index 4d20d5acd..7fe6e2345 100644
--- a/app/javascript/dashboard/components/ChatList.vue
+++ b/app/javascript/dashboard/components/ChatList.vue
@@ -763,6 +763,23 @@ function updateAssigneeTab(selectedTab) {
     });
     return;
   }
+  // Unread: keep the active tab reflected in the URL (?assignee_type=...) for
+  // all three tabs, so the address bar always matches the highlighted tab and
+  // the view is deep-linkable. The deep-link watcher then syncs the tab state
+  // and refetches. Always explicit (unlike unattended, whose default is "me").
+  if (props.conversationType === 'unread') {
+    const queryByTab = {
+      [wootConstants.ASSIGNEE_TYPE.ME]: 'me',
+      [wootConstants.ASSIGNEE_TYPE.UNASSIGNED]: 'unassigned',
+      [wootConstants.ASSIGNEE_TYPE.ALL]: 'all',
+    };
+    router.push({
+      name: 'conversation_unread',
+      params: { accountId: currentAccountId.value },
+      query: { assignee_type: queryByTab[selectedTab] ?? 'all' },
+    });
+    return;
+  }
   if (activeAssigneeTab.value !== selectedTab) {
     resetBulkActions();
     emitter.emit('clearSearchInput');
